{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
Du bist am 29. Februar geboren?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002C:}}Cool!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Wenn du alle vier Jahre Geburtstag
hast, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}lebst du auch vier Mal länger,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
oder, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}You were born on {{TAG:0004:000E:00CD}} {{TAG:0004:000F:00CD}}?
That's so cool!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}If this were a game, I'd expect to
get a lot of coins today! Ha ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sen {{TAG:0004:000E:00CD}} {{TAG:0004:000F:00CD}} tarihinde mi doğdun?
